# Copy to ~/.ssh/config.local for machine-specific or private SSH overrides.
# This file is gitignored and auto-included by the main config.
#
# SECURITY NOTE: The main config sets ForwardAgent no, ForwardX11 no,
# HashKnownHosts yes, and IdentitiesOnly yes. Avoid weakening these
# defaults unless you understand the risk for a specific host.
#
# Example:
# Host work-bastion
#   HostName bastion.example.com
#   User myuser
#
# Host sauron
#   Hostname sauron.example.com
#   User myuser
#   Port 8179
